== Description ==

'''Bottled Water''' is an edible food item in ''[[Human Host]]'', looted from containers and zombie corpses, or foraged in the wild. It appears as an ingredient in 5 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[Clay]], [[Sand]], [[Glue]], [[Antibiotics]], [[Painkiller]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

